# Only core implementation, configuration, provenance, and documentation.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.py
!*.pyi
!*.c
!*.cc
!*.cpp
!*.h
!*.hpp
!*.cu
!*.cuh
!*.sh
!*.ps1
!*.bat
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.toml
!*.ini
!*.cfg
!*.json
!*.md
!*.rst
!requirements*.txt
!LICENSE*
!LICENCE*
!COPYING*
!NOTICE*
!README*
# Runtime outputs remain in method-local log/exp folders.
**/log/**
**/logs/**
**/exp/**
**/experiments/**
**/checkpoints/**
**/checkpoint/**
**/saved_model/**
**/saved_models/**
**/runs/**
**/wandb/**
**/cache/**
**/.cache/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache/**
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
**/envs/**
**/.git/**
/.upstream_git/**
# Author-provided dataset manifests/labels are not core configuration.
**/data/**/*.json
**/datasets/**/*.json
**/Dataset/**/*.json
**/Datasets/**/*.json
# Paper assets, model blobs, datasets, figures, and logs are excluded by
# the allowlist, including PDF, MAT, NPZ/NPY, PT/PTH/PKL, PNG, CSV, JSONL.

